{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00324",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.2,
      "end_seconds": 5.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Ready for you, doctor. I'll stay in case you need anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.48,
      "end_seconds": 10.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Great. Hello, come in and sit down. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 11.25,
      "end_seconds": 21.27,
      "duration_seconds": 10.02,
      "text": "Doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps. Doctor, it's itchy raised red welts. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.8,
      "end_seconds": 26.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "And when did that start? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.59,
      "end_seconds": 32.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "Okay, so just since yesterday. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.36,
      "end_seconds": 36.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "How bad is it, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.4,
      "end_seconds": 43.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Well, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.06,
      "end_seconds": 49.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.48,
      "end_seconds": 51.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Mild, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.72,
      "end_seconds": 59.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.36,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 59.18,
      "end_seconds": 63.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.73,
      "end_seconds": 67.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "I, I was getting to that!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.34,
      "end_seconds": 71.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Has there been welts that move around too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.7,
      "end_seconds": 75.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Um, yes, for about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.25,
      "end_seconds": 79.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "How much is it bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.62,
      "end_seconds": 86.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Well, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.92,
      "end_seconds": 92.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.83,
      "end_seconds": 98.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "I'd give it a three, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.97,
      "end_seconds": 105.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "Alright, have you had itchy raised red welts before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.24,
      "end_seconds": 111.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Uh, you know, I had a similar thing last winter. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.35,
      "end_seconds": 115.11,
      "duration_seconds": 0.76,
      "text": "Any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.66,
      "end_seconds": 117.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "No. No fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 118.7,
      "end_seconds": 123.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice fever. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.69,
      "end_seconds": 129.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Right, no, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.49,
      "end_seconds": 136.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.81,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. What about new medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.17,
      "end_seconds": 140.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Not at all, no new medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.97,
      "end_seconds": 145.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any throat tightness, wheezing or joint pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.65,
      "end_seconds": 157.32,
      "duration_seconds": 10.67,
      "text": "No, no throat tightness, no wheezing, no joint pain. I did have a burning feeling on the skin at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.84,
      "end_seconds": 161.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Okay, your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.63,
      "end_seconds": 163.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.77,
      "end_seconds": 167.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.31,
      "end_seconds": 170.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.46,
      "end_seconds": 175.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.09,
      "end_seconds": 179.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Uh, not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.97,
      "end_seconds": 182.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.0,
      "end_seconds": 186.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Um, of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.64,
      "end_seconds": 199.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.26,
      "end_seconds": 202.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "I've never smoked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.75,
      "end_seconds": 204.7,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.15,
      "end_seconds": 209.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "I don't drink at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.78,
      "end_seconds": 213.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.53,
      "end_seconds": 225.5,
      "duration_seconds": 10.97,
      "text": "I've had asthma for two years now. My family kept telling me to get it checked. I've had eczema, yes. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.84,
      "end_seconds": 229.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.1,
      "end_seconds": 234.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "My father was diabetic. My brother has asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.34,
      "end_seconds": 237.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.55,
      "end_seconds": 239.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.48,
      "end_seconds": 243.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 244.27,
      "end_seconds": 252.32,
      "duration_seconds": 8.05,
      "text": "Um, she is on Seretide inhaler, twice a day for my asthma, I give it to her."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 253.16,
      "end_seconds": 257.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Oh, I used to take Asthalin inhaler, but I stopped it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 258.1,
      "end_seconds": 265.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.96,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Temperature is 36.8 degrees, saturation 99 percent. Heart rate 80, blood pressure 128 over 69."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.63,
      "end_seconds": 266.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.65,
      "end_seconds": 270.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.78,
      "end_seconds": 272.48,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.68,
      "end_seconds": 289.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Okay, here we go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.03,
      "end_seconds": 295.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.99,
      "end_seconds": 298.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Hold your arm out like this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.41,
      "end_seconds": 316.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "There are raised pink welts on the chest and back, some joined together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.84,
      "end_seconds": 320.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.7,
      "end_seconds": 336.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Lips look a little puffy, but the tongue and throat are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.66,
      "end_seconds": 358.92,
      "duration_seconds": 17.26,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. From what you've told me and what I found, I think we're dealing with acute urticaria, possibly allergic at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. I can't rule out a drug reaction yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 359.87,
      "end_seconds": 362.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.2,
      "end_seconds": 377.94,
      "duration_seconds": 14.74,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like acute urticaria, possibly allergic, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had itchy raised red welts, yesterday, mild, and no wheezing or joint pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 378.34,
      "end_seconds": 381.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Uh, yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 382.25,
      "end_seconds": 409.63,
      "duration_seconds": 27.38,
      "text": "We should do blood tests for urticaria. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. We should do an allergy test for recurrent urticaria. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. I'd like you to take levocetirizine, 5 milligrams, once a day, for two weeks. You take it by mouth. That's for hives. Write down anything new you ate, took or used before this started, even small things."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 410.4,
      "end_seconds": 428.04,
      "duration_seconds": 17.64,
      "text": "Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if your lips or tongue swell more, or you have trouble breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 428.82,
      "end_seconds": 430.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 431.6,
      "end_seconds": 433.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Come back in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 434.36,
      "end_seconds": 437.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 438.46,
      "end_seconds": 443.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Let me check that I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 443.7,
      "end_seconds": 452.37,
      "duration_seconds": 8.67,
      "text": "So, I take the levocetirizine, 5 milligrams, once a day and come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0071",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 452.82,
      "end_seconds": 457.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Right, yes, exactly right. Take care, and don't hesitate to call if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0072",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 458.41,
      "end_seconds": 460.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "No, you've explained it well. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0073",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 462.04,
      "end_seconds": 463.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}